OL,3,GNEWSASwim group 'furious' with
OL,4,A'dangerous' sewage spills
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of sea swimmers have said they
OL,7,Fare "furious" after multiple sewage
OL,8,Fspills left their club's regular
OL,9,Fbathing spot "dangerous" and
OL,10,F"unusable".
OL,12,FElizabeth Mills, from Corfe Mullen is
OL,13,Fone of the members of East Dorset Open
OL,14,FWater Swimming Club, and she said she
OL,15,Fwas was alerted to the discharges at
OL,16,FShore Road beach, near Sandbanks, on
OL,17,FTuesday, via the Surfers Against Sewage
OL,18,Fapp.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
