OL,3,GNEWSASwim group 'furious' with
OL,4,A'dangerous' sewage spills
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said she was "fuming" that her club
OL,7,Fwas forced to cancel its weekly swim at
OL,8,Fthe beach, which currently holds a blue
OL,9,Fflag in recognition of its excellent
OL,10,Fwater quality.
OL,12,FWessex Water said it is spending "more
OL,13,Fthan #8m every month" to reduce
OL,14,Fdischarges.
